    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_SING_THE_STONES_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: Sing the Stones.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Every City Ruins you have seen within 3 plots of your borders, where you could found a city, becomes a city of yours of size 3.",
